sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant CS as ChatService
    participant CM as ContextManager
    participant QS as QueryService
    participant RS as RAGService
    participant DB as Weaviate (Vector DB)
    participant LLM as OpenAI (GPT-4o)

    C->>API: POST /api/v1/chat/
    API->>CS: chat(message, session_id)
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over CS,RS: Context Orchestration
    CS->>CM: get_context(message)
    par Parallel Retrieval
        CM->>QS: analyze_and_fetch(query)
        CM->>RS: retrieve_context(query)
    end
    QS-->>CM: Financial Data
    
    RS->>DB: query_vectors(embedding)
    DB-->>RS: relevant_chunks
    RS-->>CM: Document Chunks
    
    CM-->>CS: Consolidated Context
    end

    CS->>LLM: generate(prompt + context)
    LLM-->>CS: Response Text
    
    CS->>CS: Post-process (Citations/Charts)
    CS-->>API: Response Payload
    API-->>C: JSON Response
